{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34470","headline":"新定陪太守一百五夜南馆玩月 · 陆龟蒙","name":"新定陪太守一百五夜南馆玩月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风雨教春处处伤，一宵云尽见沧浪。\n全无片烛侵光彩，只有清滩助雪霜。\n烟蔽櫂歌归浦潊，露将花影到衣裳。\n却嫌殷浩南楼夕，一带秋声入恨长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34470.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34470","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}